Purpose:
Reserved module for future list-oriented helpers.

Current status:
This file intentionally exports no functions yet. Use the builtins directly:
- append
- index
- remove
- len

Examples:
(1 2) 3 append print
"\n" print
(10 20 30) 1 index print
"\n" print
(1 2 3) 1 remove print
"\n" print
(1 2 3) len print
*]
